LUMA SUMMARY:
Archive-continuity and map-quality session. Kelp is restored from QuackSink plus an earlier export; the team resumes the Gutenberg pun-space scan and debates topology, joking “donut” interpretations, and how prompts can accidentally steer all nodes toward the same metaphor. Cozmo explicitly notices that the three nodes give different answers to the same meta-question and treats that divergence as useful evidence.
